#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:119
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/kg-qa-report
msgid "A committed QA sidecar recording, for one knowledge-graph subject such as a process, role or skill, which of its references fail to resolve under each audit criterion."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:63
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/actor
msgid "A concrete participant, human, agentic or mechanical, that persists across every process and takes on roles. Which login is which actor is the data store's to know."
msgstr "Un participant concret, humain, agentique ou mécanique, qui persiste à travers tous les processus et endosse des rôles. Quel identifiant correspond à quel acteur, c'est au magasin de données de le savoir."

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:23
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/associated-harness
msgid "A harness this one knows by name, site and repository, and never loads, builds or copies. The fourth relation beside depends (needs), references (remoteGraphs) and utilizes (dependencies)."
msgstr "Un harnais que celui-ci connaît par son nom, son site et son dépôt, et qu'il ne charge, ne construit ni ne copie jamais. La quatrième relation à côté de dépend (needs), référence (remoteGraphs) et utilise (dependencies)."

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:141
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/json-schema
msgid "A JSON document that describes the shape of other JSON documents. In the platform, a node schema and a skill's input and output contracts are each a JSON Schema file."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:13
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/glossary
msgid "A layer's terms and what they mean, as a SKOS concept scheme: local terms linked to external concepts, plus external concepts listed without being copied."
msgstr "Les termes d'une couche et ce qu'ils signifient, sous forme de schéma de concepts SKOS : des termes locaux liés à des concepts externes, plus des concepts externes listés sans être copiés."

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:105
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/voice
msgid "A named set of writing rules for prose, active in the roles and processes it names. The voice points at the role it is written for; the role names no voice."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:112
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/external-schema
msgid "A record of a specification the platform depends on but does not hold: which authority publishes it, which version is conformed to, and the operative terms used from it."
msgstr ""

