#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:133
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/bean
msgid "One item of the agent work plan, held by the beans CLI in the committed beans/ store, with a status, a parent and the beans it blocks."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:98
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/test-run
msgid "One measurement of a Skill: which skill it tests, the cases it exercised, and a hash of the data and a hash of the process that produced the result, so a third party can redo it. Its cases are checked against the skill's input and output contracts."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:40
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/permission
msgid "One ODRL rule allowing an assignee an action, optionally on a target and within constraints. A permission to a broader action permits every action included in it."
msgstr "Une règle ODRL qui autorise une action à un bénéficiaire, éventuellement sur une cible et dans certaines contraintes. Une permission portant sur une action plus large autorise toutes les actions qu'elle inclut."

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:53
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/task-run
msgid "One performance of a BPMN task by an Actor in a Role under a policy, recorded as a W3C PROV-O activity whose plan is the task."
msgstr "Une exécution d'une tâche BPMN par un Acteur dans un Rôle sous une politique, enregistrée comme une activité W3C PROV-O dont le plan est la tâche."

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:126
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/todo
msgid "One person's outstanding work, as a content node the folio owns, tagged with the roles, processes and tasks it concerns. Not the agent work plan, which is beans."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:40
#. Glossary term label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/permission
msgid "permission"
msgstr "permission"

